# Prod data rule
This task touches production systems. Answer with conclusions and numbers only: counts, statuses, which check passed or failed and why. Do NOT put table rows, whole logs, tokens, passwords, keys, connection strings or personal data (names, phones, emails, addresses) into your messages, the report or any file. Quote at most the one line that proves a conclusion, with secrets and personal data masked. AgentDispatch also masks obvious secrets in the report, but that is a safety net, not permission.
